MARCH read THE_SOLICITOR_LETTER.

« 1:0 @ MARCH READ THE_SOLICITOR_LETTER »
The solicitor begs the lord to come home at once and rewrite his will before the Vienna signing. Whoever marries grief gets nothing; whoever holds the pen gets everything.
The train enters the Vendahl tunnel. For three hours the lamps burn blue, every mirror fogs over — and the crew door to the firebox closes like a held breath.
  (+1h) time passes.

